COMP - compare two files››Syntax:› COMP [d:][path]file1 [d:][path]file2›      [offset1 [offset2]]››Compares two files byte by byte and›reports the positions and values that›differ, and which file ends first. The›optional offsets (from 0, up to 24›bits) are where the comparison starts›in each file; default 0.››Example:› COMP A.DAT B.DAT› ?dif at 00000A:0A & 00000A:9B› B.DAT EOF›